  <section class="intro-section" aria-labelledby="intro-heading"><div class="container"><div class="intro-grid"><div class="intro-text"><div class="section-label">Serving Carson</div><h2 class="section-title" id="intro-heading">Real Help for Real Buyers in Carson</h2><p>If you're looking to buy in <strong>Carson</strong>, you're looking at one of the best overall value propositions in the South Bay. A city with spacious lots, good schools, easy freeway access, and median prices around $800K — which means FHA and conventional loans are both in play for most buyers. <strong>Carson</strong> is where families who have been priced out of Torrance and Redondo Beach often land and find that the value-for-dollar here is genuinely difficult to match.</p><p>I help buyers across all of <strong>Carson</strong>'s zip codes — 90745 and 90746 primarily, with some 90749 commercial activity — figure out the right program, get fully approved, and close fast. Whether you're a first-time buyer using FHA or an investor building a South Bay rental portfolio, I have the programs and the expertise to get it done.</p><div style="margin-top:1.5rem;display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;"><a href="#contact" class="btn-gold">Start My Free Pre-Approval</a><a href="tel:+13105945362" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.4rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;font-size:0.94rem;">📞 Call (310) 594-5362</a></div></div><div class="intro-badges"><div class="intro-badge"><div class="intro-badge-value">$800K</div><div class="intro-badge-label">City median — FHA widely available, strong value vs. coastal South Bay cities</div></div><div class="intro-badge"><div class="intro-badge-value">Spacious Lots</div><div class="intro-badge-label">Carson homes typically offer larger lot sizes than most South Bay cities at this price range</div></div><div class="intro-badge"><div class="intro-badge-value">CAMS School</div><div class="intro-badge-label">California Academy of Math & Science — one of the best public STEM schools in California</div></div></div></div></div></section>
