        <p class="section-sub">Whether you're a first-time buyer, moving up, investing, or thinking about retirement equity — here's what I can do for buyers and homeowners in Carson.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="loans-grid">
        <div class="loan-card"><div class="loan-icon">🏠</div><h3>FHA Loans</h3><div class="loan-tags"><span class="loan-tag">3.5% Down</span><span class="loan-tag">580+ Credit</span><span class="loan-tag">First-Time Buyers</span></div><p>FHA loans are highly effective across most of Carson. With a city median around $800K, most SFRs and many condos fall within FHA program parameters. Down payment as low as 3.5%, credit scores from 580. One of the best FHA-accessible cities in the South Bay.</p><a href="https://www.rudycorona.com/services/fha" class="loan-link">Learn about FHA loans →</a></div>
        <div class="loan-card"><div class="loan-icon">🏡</div><h3>Conventional &amp; Jumbo</h3><div class="loan-tags"><span class="loan-tag">3% Down Option</span><span class="loan-tag">All Price Points</span><span class="loan-tag">Best Rates</span></div><p>Conventional loans cover most Carson transactions. Programs from 3–5% down for qualifying buyers. Most properties in 90745 and 90746 are well within conventional loan parameters with strong appraisal support.</p><a href="https://www.rudycorona.com/services/conventional" class="loan-link">Explore conventional &amp; jumbo →</a></div>
        <div class="loan-card"><div class="loan-icon">📈</div><h3>DSCR Investment Loans</h3><div class="loan-tags"><span class="loan-tag">No Tax Returns</span><span class="loan-tag">Rental Income</span><span class="loan-tag">Investors</span></div><p>Carson has strong rental demand from its location along the I-405 and I-110 corridors. DSCR loans qualify on rental income — great for investors targeting Carson's single-family and duplex rental market.</p><a href="https://www.rudycorona.com/services/dscr" class="loan-link">Learn about DSCR loans →</a></div>
